      "side": 1,
      "message": "what problem does this change solve?\n\ni\u0027m concerned disabling this feature will cause problems for situations\nwhere people flash back to older FW images. the factory image didn\u0027t\nsupport CBI-in-flash, so we need to be a bit careful about\ninadvertently creating an unrecoverable workflow.\n\nwhat might make more sense is to check the board-ID at runtime\nand disable this feature dynamically on future board spins.",
      "revId": "efaad46c2280ccf69a87bae30eab96bc38306ccd",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
