      "writtenOn": "2023-10-13T08:51:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "ok we are actually doing the transfer only when CBI in EC flash is empty or corrupted\n\nIf I leave it as it is and in future boards we remove EEPROM, if CBI in EC flash is somehow corrupted and this feature tried to transfer from EEPROM, it might break things because there is no EEPROM\n\nShould we make this change when we stop support for proto2",
      "parentUuid": "401baf7c_365bc13c",
      "revId": "efaad46c2280ccf69a87bae30eab96bc38306ccd",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
